{
  "sourceId": "post-Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors-zh-TW",
  "locale": "zh-TW",
  "source": {
    "kind": "single-post",
    "postId": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵我們都經歷過這種情況。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你打開一個測試檔案，期待能理解程式碼的功能，結果卻看到一個讓你質疑一切的怪物。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "單元測試本應讓我們的生活更輕鬆——它們記錄行為、捕捉回歸問題，並讓我們有信心進行重構。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "但有時候，它們卻變成了它們本該防止的東西：無法維護的噩夢。↵讓我分享一些我在實際工作中遇到的最醜陋的單元測試。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "名字已經改變以保護有罪者，但恐怖是真實的。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::danger{title=\"🔥 問題所在\"}↵這個測試違反了基本原則：一個測試，一個關注點。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "當這個測試失敗時，五種不同行為中的哪一個壞了？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你需要除錯整個方法才能找出答案。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "測試變得相互依賴——如果使用者建立失敗，其他所有東西也會失敗，隱藏了其他潛在的錯誤。↵**應該怎麼做**：五個獨立的測試，每個都有清楚的名稱描述它驗證什麼。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "當 testUserDeletion 失敗時，你確切知道該看哪裡。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::warning{title=\"⏰ 問題所在\"}↵基於時間的測試是不穩定的噩夢。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在快速的機器上，5 秒可能足夠。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在負載下的慢速 CI 伺服器上，可能不夠。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "測試在本地通過但在生產環境中隨機失敗。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "開發人員開始忽略測試失敗，因為「又是那個不穩定的測試」。↵**應該怎麼做**：使用適當的同步機制——回呼、promise 或帶超時的輪詢。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果可能的話，模擬非同步行為。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "永遠不要依賴任意的睡眠時間。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::bug{title=\"問題所在\"}↵大量重複使維護成為噩夢。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "需要改變使用者物件結構？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在 50 個地方更新它。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "設定程式碼比實際測試邏輯還長，將重要部分埋在雜訊中。↵**應該怎麼做**：提取測試固件，使用工廠函數，或利用測試設定方法。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "測試應該專注於使其獨特的東西，而不是重複樣板程式碼。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::question{title=\"問題所在\"}↵這些數字是什麼意思？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "為什麼 315 是預期結果？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "折扣是 10% 還是 0.1%？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "當這個測試失敗時，你會花 10 分鐘用計算機算數學，然後才能開始除錯。↵**應該怎麼做**：使用命名常數或變數來解釋計算。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "const decimal ITEM_PRICE = 100m; const int QUANTITY = 2; const decimal DISCOUNT_PERCENT = 10m; 現在測試自己記錄自己。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::info{title=\"🤦 問題所在\"}↵這些測試驗證 Java 的標準函式庫是否正常工作。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "劇透：它確實正常。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Oracle 已經廣泛測試了 ArrayList 和 HashMap。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這些測試增加零價值，同時增加維護負擔和建置時間。↵**應該怎麼做**：測試你的程式碼，而不是框架。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你沒有添加任何業務邏輯，你不需要測試。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::tip{title=\"問題所在\"}↵只是重複程式碼所做的事情的註解是雜訊。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "它們不增加清晰度——它們增加混亂。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你的測試需要這麼多註解才能理解，測試本身寫得很差。↵**應該怎麼做**：編寫具有清楚變數名稱和結構的自我記錄程式碼。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使用測試名稱來描述正在測試什麼。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "註解應該解釋為什麼，而不是什麼。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::failure{title=\"問題所在\"}↵這個測試總是通過，因為它沒有斷言任何東西。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這是一種虛假的安全感。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "付款可能失敗、拋出內部捕獲的異常或返回錯誤——測試仍然是綠色的。↵**應該怎麼做**：斷言預期結果。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "付款成功了嗎？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "資料庫更新了嗎？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使用者收到確認了嗎？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "沒有斷言的測試不是測試。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::warning{title=\"🎭 問題所在\"}↵你正在測試模擬返回你告訴它們返回的東西。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這個測試對實際業務邏輯沒有驗證任何東西。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "它與現實如此隔離，以至於在生產程式碼完全損壞時它可能通過。↵**應該怎麼做**：模擬外部依賴（資料庫、API、檔案系統），但不要模擬所有東西。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "盡可能用真實物件測試真實邏輯。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "整合測試補充單元測試——兩者都使用。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::danger{title=\"問題所在\"}↵跳過的測試是永遠不會償還的技術債務。「稍後修復」變成「永遠不修復」。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這些測試腐爛，隨著時間的推移變得更過時、更難修復。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "最終，沒有人記得為什麼它們被跳過或它們應該測試什麼。↵**應該怎麼做**：修復測試或刪除它。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果它真的不穩定，使其確定性。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果它測試的東西不再重要，刪除它。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "跳過的測試比沒有測試更糟——它們給予虛假的信心。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使這些測試醜陋的不僅僅是糟糕的風格——而是它們在測試的基本目的上失敗了：提供程式碼正確工作的信心和它應該如何行為的文件。↵好的測試有共同的特徵：↵**專注**：一個測試，一個行為。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "當它失敗時，你確切知道什麼壞了。↵**可讀**：測試名稱和結構清楚地傳達正在測試什麼以及為什麼。↵**確定性**：相同的輸入，相同的輸出，每次都是。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "沒有不穩定性，沒有隨機性，沒有時間依賴性。↵**快速**：測試應該在毫秒內運行，而不是秒。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "慢速測試不會被運行。↵**獨立**：測試不依賴彼此或共享狀態。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "它們可以以任何順序運行。↵**可維護**：當需求改變時，測試易於更新。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "重複最小化。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你在這些例子中認出自己的程式碼，不要感到難過——我們都寫過醜陋的測試。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "重要的是學習和改進。↵當你寫下一個測試時，問問自己：↵如果這個測試在六個月後失敗，我會理解為什麼嗎？↵我是在測試我的程式碼還是框架？↵我能刪除一半的設定程式碼並仍然有一個有效的測試嗎？↵這個測試給我信心程式碼能工作嗎？↵單元測試是一項隨著實踐而提高的技能。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們今天寫的醜陋測試教會我們明天寫更好的測試。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "與你的團隊分享你的測試恐怖故事。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "嘲笑它們。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "從中學習。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "最重要的是，重構它們。↵因為唯一比醜陋測試更糟的是根本沒有測試。↵:::success{title=\"✨ 一線希望\"}↵每個醜陋的測試都是學習的機會。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "程式碼審查捕捉這些問題。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "重構改進它們。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "分享這些故事幫助整個社群寫更好的測試。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們都在一起。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "醜陋的單元測試 - 測試恐怖故事集",
